193
00:09:26,920 --> 00:09:28,000
Oh, easy!

194
00:09:29,180 --> 00:09:30,380
Yay!

195
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:32,080
They really came home!

196
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:33,580
We missed you!

197
00:09:33,860 --> 00:09:35,700
