It's Belle.

209
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:54,780
I'd prefer if you didn't treat me like a toy this time.

210
00:09:55,500 --> 00:09:57,620
Hey, Brad is a pretty doll to play with.

211
00:09:57,740 --> 00:09:58,180
Yay!

212
00:09:58,180 --> 00:10:00,360
She's so neat!

213
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:01,280
